WEBVTT

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.534
Hello, I'm Lizzie.

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:04.137
I'm a third year
studying Human Computer Interaction.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:08.274
A really good way to connect with faculty,
especially within your department,

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.211
would be TAing or grading for a class.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:14.547
I'm currently a TA for
Interaction Design Fundamentals.

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.883
And first of all,
it's a lot of fun.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.418
I am learning so much,

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:20.320
even though I've technically
already taken the class.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.689
And you really get to
connect with the professors

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.758
sort of see the industry from a different light.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:30.830
It's a great opportunity to learn
more about both the academia side of HCI

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.132
or whatever department you're in,

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:35.035
but also get industry insights from professors

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.003
who maybe don't teach full-time,

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.639
but they had a job in the
industry or anything like that.